# What a trial login may reach once fleet.trial.egress (or FLEET_TRIAL_EGRESS in
# machine.env) is `block` — WACK C3, bin/fleet_trial_egress.py. One host name,
# address or CIDR a line; names are resolved on the machine every pass (60 s).
# DNS (port 53) and the hub's own host are always allowed; mail ports 25 / 465 /
# 587 are refused even to a host listed here. Loopback is never touched.
#
# Code hosting — clone, fetch, push, the API, release downloads
github.com
api.github.com
codeload.github.com
objects.githubusercontent.com
raw.githubusercontent.com
